The reasons for carrying out symmetry reduction are given in the "reasons" directory.  This gives the representation that needs removing as the 3rd.

To run NEIGHCRYS, type
   cp NEIGHCRYS_input/* .
   neighcrys.out < neighcrys_answers

To run DMACRYS, type
   dmacrys.out < PAPTUX_CO1_Z2.dmain > PAPTUX_CO1_Z2.dmaout

There are some changes required to give files suitable to take forwards to subsequent calculations.  These are in the "final_minimization" directory.
